["Grab your closest ally and set out on an adventure to dominate the deep reaches of Azeroth! In this single-life Hardcore challenge, you and one friend will partner up to tackle all vanilla dungeons in order. Succeed, and you'll earn your place as one of Azeroth's most dynamic duos. Fail, and your character will fall in the depths like so many before.\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:639|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Edwin VanCleef] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 21|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3654|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Mutanus the Devourer] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 22|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4275|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Archmage Arugal] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 26|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4829|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Aku'mai] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 28|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4421|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Charlga Razorflank] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 33|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7800|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Mekgineer Thermaplugg] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 34|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:4543|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Bloodmage Thalnos] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 34|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:6487|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Arcanist Doan] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 37|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:3975|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Herod] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 40|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:7358|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Amnennar]|cffffffffbefore reaching level 41|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:2748|hYou must kill |cffffff00[Archaedas] |cffffffffbefore reaching level 47|r. |cffffff00(Click Here!) |cffffffff |r|h\n\n|Hascensiondb:npc:12236|hYou must kill |cffff